    "en": {
      "trackName": "Five: Watch Puzzle Games",
      "description": "Five calm logic puzzles, built for the watch from the first pixel.\n\nPIPES — turn the pieces and watch the route fill from inlet to outlet.\nMINES — classic Minesweeper on a 4×4 board, always solvable without guessing.\nMINI SUDOKU — numbers 1 to 4 in a tiny grid, with gentle hints.\nSLIDE PUZZLE — the 15 puzzle in a wrist-sized 3×3 version.\n2048 — swipe, merge and chase the big tile.\n\nMADE FOR THE WRIST\n• Boards sized for real fingers on every Apple Watch, from 40 mm up\n• Tactile graphite tiles, smooth animations and light haptics\n• Endless puzzles generated on the watch, three difficulties each\n• Free hints and Undo, no timers, no lives, no pressure\n• Your game is saved after every move — continue any time\n• Works fully offline, no account, no ads, no tracking\n\nONE GAME FREE, FOREVER\nChoose any one of the five games and keep it free with every level and hint. Unlock all five with a single one-time purchase — no subscription. Family Sharing is supported.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/five-watch-puzzle-games/id6828784990?uo=4",
